        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Backgrounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world once belonged to us, at least that’s what we believed. Until that day, everything changed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those meteorite craters were like gates to hell, from which swarmed the 【Alien Bugs】 that destroyed everything, leaving only ruins behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there was the 【Bug Virus】 spreading through the air—once infected, no matter how strong one’s willpower, they would turn into mindless 【Zombie Thugs】.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is what I still remember after being rescued by the 【Survivors’ Alliance】. As for what I did before the disaster or where I lived, I have no memory at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that doesn’t matter anymore. All I know is that I didn’t become one of the walking dead—instead, I was modified and trained into a 【Bug Slayer】, specialized in exterminating alien insects and zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although those terrifying monsters still roam everywhere, the Alliance has a new project, codenamed 【Rebirth】.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And I will contribute my last ounce of strength, returning to those occupied city ruins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—————— Bug Slayer PT021 · Log</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Bug Slayer】Survivors who have been modified and trained, dispatched by the【Survivor Alliance】to various locations for final missions as part of the 【Rebirth Project】.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/ca3cfb0654efc0d9c49e33f74358a7a2.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Bug Rebuilder】Their origins and identities remain unverified, but they are undoubtedly crucial to the【Rebirth Project】. Stay alert for SOS signals related to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/0186d05dceb729b8e768cd9971ecb40f.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Survival Resources】Make full use of collected weapons, food, medicine, and other resources to keep alive ...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/0d626e1042813bf30b97cb4459036276.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Alien Bugs】Extraterrestrial &quot;bugs&quot; that drift through space via meteorites, invading and plundering survival resources from other planets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/0d74159f9cabf257707dbdd6c9d244a2.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Zombie Thugs】Former compatriots infected by the【Bug Virus】, now reduced to irrational, frenzied monsters. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/c3acc4e78c3fa03a68e524c54af842f7.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Chaser】Extremely dangerous entities, yet not entirely invincible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/f8bd40416189c6fd9c27c9b9685d8e43.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're interested in this game, don't forget to add it to your wishlist. You're welcome to join our community groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 651050017</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: TTgqANC5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email: <a href=\"mailto:polatouchestudio@outlook.com\">polatouchestudio@outlook.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Backgrounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world once belonged to us, at least that’s what we believed. Until that day, everything changed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those meteorite craters were like gates to hell, from which swarmed the 【Alien Bugs】 that destroyed everything, leaving only ruins behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there was the 【Bug Virus】 spreading through the air—once infected, no matter how strong one’s willpower, they would turn into mindless 【Zombie Thugs】.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is what I still remember after being rescued by the 【Survivors’ Alliance】. As for what I did before the disaster or where I lived, I have no memory at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that doesn’t matter anymore. All I know is that I didn’t become one of the walking dead—instead, I was modified and trained into a 【Bug Slayer】, specialized in exterminating alien insects and zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although those terrifying monsters still roam everywhere, the Alliance has a new project, codenamed 【Rebirth】.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And I will contribute my last ounce of strength, returning to those occupied city ruins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—————— Bug Slayer PT021 · Log</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Bug Slayer】Survivors who have been modified and trained, dispatched by the【Survivor Alliance】to various locations for final missions as part of the 【Rebirth Project】.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/ca3cfb0654efc0d9c49e33f74358a7a2.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Bug Rebuilder】Their origins and identities remain unverified, but they are undoubtedly crucial to the【Rebirth Project】. Stay alert for SOS signals related to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/0186d05dceb729b8e768cd9971ecb40f.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Survival Resources】Make full use of collected weapons, food, medicine, and other resources to keep alive ...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/0d626e1042813bf30b97cb4459036276.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Alien Bugs】Extraterrestrial &quot;bugs&quot; that drift through space via meteorites, invading and plundering survival resources from other planets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/0d74159f9cabf257707dbdd6c9d244a2.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Zombie Thugs】Former compatriots infected by the【Bug Virus】, now reduced to irrational, frenzied monsters. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/c3acc4e78c3fa03a68e524c54af842f7.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Chaser】Extremely dangerous entities, yet not entirely invincible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/f8bd40416189c6fd9c27c9b9685d8e43.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're interested in this game, don't forget to add it to your wishlist. You're welcome to join our community groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 651050017</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: TTgqANC5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email: <a href=\"mailto:polatouchestudio@outlook.com\">polatouchestudio@outlook.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "【Bug Slayer PT021 · Final · Log】 As the heavy truck sways forward across the sandy terrain, the ruins of the city ahead are now visible. Is this the location assigned to me? Time is running short. Before my antibodies and life are depleted, I must do as much as possible for humanity...",
